abstract: >
  A reader for the output of the Layton/Hu mathematical model of the human
  nephron. It does not run the model: it lays its output out for six scenarios
  (healthy female and male, moderate diabetes, hypertension, SGLT2 inhibition
  in each sex) so that it can be read, compared and checked: profiles along a
  segment and along the nephron, nephron types, scenarios side by side,
  transporter fluxes with a mass-balance check, validation and provenance
  pages. Built with Streamlit, DuckDB and Plotly. Formerly "Nefron Veri
  Gezgini".
